      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to $\\frac{10t+12}{15t+18}?$",
      "worked_solution": "We factor the numerator and denominator and cancel any factors that they have in common.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{10t+12}{15t+18} & =\\frac{2(5t+6)}{3(5t+6)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cancel{(5t+6)}}{3\\cancel{(5t+6)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
